{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06333","headline":"酬汴州李别驾赠 · 祖咏","name":"酬汴州李别驾赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋风多客思，行旅厌艰辛。\n自洛非才子，游梁得主人。\n文章参末议，荣贱岂同伦。\n叹逝逢三演，怀贤忆四真。\n情因恩旧好，契托死生亲。\n所媿能投赠，清言益润身。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"祖咏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06333.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06333","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}